87
00:05:19,570 --> 00:05:21,560
- He knows, fuck.
- What now?

88
00:05:22,780 --> 00:05:24,800
Yeah, I'm in here. Why are you here?!

89
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:26,600
I'm here to do the report.

90
